    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/79fdc033e3bb9f9b05c561262adfe76b.avif?t=1726335949\" /></div>  <br>The Angels rule over Pheonix City with an iron fist as the people remain blissfully unaware of their crimes...<br>You were supposed to lose your virginity on that day, but a mysterious creature appeared to put an end to that! Apparently your chastity is the key to defeating the corrupt Angels!<br> With a renewed sense or purpose, you begin to plot against the Angels in order to restore peace to your beloved city.<br>Why did the Angels betray the city? What hidden secrets does the city hold? What consequences await once you prevail?<br>All these mysteries will be unveiled in the end...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/08de24f8b211538bb6c3be9bf657aa9d.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/08de24f8b211538bb6c3be9bf657aa9d.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9fb5b72586b62d210bd970e879a128b8.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9fb5b72586b62d210bd970e879a128b8.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/e94e0c3b7032eab8410de970ec9f4957.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/e94e0c3b7032eab8410de970ec9f4957.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9ba0693cba128d8813c7d781a2ba337b.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9ba0693cba128d8813c7d781a2ba337b.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/15b402d21a54a42ae8c88bc7a78dfe70.avif?t=1726335949\" /></div><br><br>\u25c7 Gameplay<br>Choose the Angel you want to defeat and build the strongest deck in a limited timeframe before you face off with her in a final battle!<br><br>\u25c7 Rogue-lite Deck-Building<br>Defeat the Angels and use their powers to put together a killer deck!<br><br>\u25c7 To Love or to Corrupt?<br>Your choices affect what happens to each defeated Angel! Will you tug at their heartstrings, or will you break their minds and bodies?<br><br>\u25c7 Most Importantly...<br>X-Angels features fully-voiced 34 H-Events and 26 Animated CGs.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/79fdc033e3bb9f9b05c561262adfe76b.avif?t=1726335949\" /></div>  <br>The Angels rule over Pheonix City with an iron fist as the people remain blissfully unaware of their crimes...<br>You were supposed to lose your virginity on that day, but a mysterious creature appeared to put an end to that! Apparently your chastity is the key to defeating the corrupt Angels!<br> With a renewed sense or purpose, you begin to plot against the Angels in order to restore peace to your beloved city.<br>Why did the Angels betray the city? What hidden secrets does the city hold? What consequences await once you prevail?<br>All these mysteries will be unveiled in the end...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/08de24f8b211538bb6c3be9bf657aa9d.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/08de24f8b211538bb6c3be9bf657aa9d.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9fb5b72586b62d210bd970e879a128b8.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9fb5b72586b62d210bd970e879a128b8.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/e94e0c3b7032eab8410de970ec9f4957.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/e94e0c3b7032eab8410de970ec9f4957.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9ba0693cba128d8813c7d781a2ba337b.poster.avif?t=1726335949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/9ba0693cba128d8813c7d781a2ba337b.webm?t=1726335949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090810/extras/15b402d21a54a42ae8c88bc7a78dfe70.avif?t=1726335949\" /></div><br><br>\u25c7 Gameplay<br>Choose the Angel you want to defeat and build the strongest deck in a limited timeframe before you face off with her in a final battle!<br><br>\u25c7 Rogue-lite Deck-Building<br>Defeat the Angels and use their powers to put together a killer deck!<br><br>\u25c7 To Love or to Corrupt?<br>Your choices affect what happens to each defeated Angel! Will you tug at their heartstrings, or will you break their minds and bodies?<br><br>\u25c7 Most Importantly...<br>X-Angels features fully-voiced 34 H-Events and 26 Animated CGs.",
